    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates through observational analysis and modeling that Arctic sea-ice loss, particularly in the Barents-Kara seas, enhances the upward propagation of planetary-scale waves, which subsequently weakens the stratospheric polar vortex and leads to cold mid-latitude winters.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
